   &trans       &kp N0       &hml RALT N1 &hml LCTRL N2 &hml LSHIFT N3 &kp LBKT                          &ru_at_mh    &ru_lpar_mh  &rpar_mh     &kp UNDER    &kp HASH     &kp TILDE
