   &trans       &kp SLASH    &kp N7       &kp N8       &kp N9       &kp RBKT     &trans       &trans     &ru_equal_mh &ru_lbrc_mh  &ru_rbrc_mh  &kp PLUS     &ru_slash_mh &kp DOLLAR
